  "agent": "Park North Real Estate",
  "text": "First time on the market in generations, this classic 1920s home presents an exceptional opportunity for contractors, builders, or buyers looking to get a foothold in the SF housing market. Situated on a large lot with room to expand, this 2-bedroom, 2-bath residence is ready for upgrades and offers tremendous potential. BRING YOUR CONTRACTORS! The main level was expanded with a permit that has since expired. The lower level also features multiple storage rooms, parking, and interior access to the main level. A level, generously sized rear yard enhances the home. Conveniently located near Ocean Avenue, neighborhood parks, Muni, and freeway access. Call today to see this Excellent Value.",
