  "text": "Welcome to 2154 30th Avenue, a charming home in San Francisco's desirable Parkside neighborhood, offering classic architectural character, comfortable living spaces, and wonderful versatility. This inviting residence features a desirable floor plan with approximately 1,600 square feet of main-level living space, offering a comfortable and functional layout for everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen has been tastefully updated with quartz countertops and a stylish backsplash, creating a bright and welcoming space for cooking and gathering. Additional highlights include an updated bathroom, a roof approximately six years old, a spacious two-car garage with epoxy flooring, and a central heating system. Conveniently located near neighborhood shops, restaurants, parks, public transportation, and Ocean Beach, this home offers a wonderful combination of classic San Francisco charm and everyday convenience. A wonderful opportunity to own a home in the sought-after Parkside neighborhood. Come and see all that this property has to offer!",
