  "agent": "Compass",
  "text": "Discover a refined take on San Francisco living at 1582 45th Ave, where contemporary comfort meets the relaxed charm of the Outer Sunset. Thoughtfully renovated throughout, this inviting home features 3 bedrooms, 2 full baths upstairs, with the living room, kitchen and a half bath conveniently situated on the main level for effortless everyday living and entertaining. Extensive upgrades include brand-new electrical and plumbing systems, a new roof, new windows, and new appliances. Radiant floor heating and high ceilings enhance the home's comfort and sense of space, while a luxurious primary bathroom offers a spa-inspired retreat. A bonus office provides flexibility for working from home, and the cozy backyard creates a welcoming setting to relax or entertain. Ideally located near Golden Gate Park and Ocean Beach, this home offers easy access to scenic outdoor escapes, neighborhood cafs, local shops, restaurants, public transportation, and highly regarded neighborhood schools. Combining extensive upgrades, versatile living spaces, and a sought-after coastal setting, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the best of San Francisco living.",
